We evaluate TGPT’s foundational capability through three diverse tasks towards different payment use cases: T-JGC: future transaction generation jointly with downstream anomaly transaction detection (Sec. 5.1);
T-RES: dining transaction trajectory generation and merchant representation learning (Sec. 5.2);
T-MCC: benchmarking MCC prediction performance with fine-tuned LLMs (Sec. 5.3).
Sec. 5.4 shows the empirical impact of several scalability designs in TGPT.
Our findings and insights through experiments are highlighted in italics.
